{
  "id": "shared",
  "title": "Shared assets",
  "summary": "Tachyon publishes the files in `client/shared` at stable `/shared/...` URLs (URLs that do not change). There are limits on the number of files and on their size in bytes. Tachyon rejects symlinks (links to other files) and anything that is not a regular file. A view reads `client/shared/data/docs.json` as `data.docs`: the page passes the number of guides to the component, and the service keeps the stable URL of the logo. A Python service also needs the `tac.python` runtime setting in `client/manifest.json`.",
